diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 83bf72b..c7f95c5 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+- Clocks are read with `monotonic()` instead of `now()`, so the `time` module can be passed as a clock. `ManualClock.now()` is now `ManualClock.monotonic()`.
 - Limiter state and snapshots carry `reset_at`, the clock time the limiter is full again, in place of the relative `reset_in`.
 - Fixed: a hit costing more than the limit (a bucket's capacity) was told to retry later although it could never succeed, and crashed with IndexError on a sliding window. It now raises `ValueError: cost N exceeds limit M` and spends nothing.
 - `TokenBucket` takes `refill_period` (seconds from empty to full) instead of `refill_per_second`.
