-| `clock.read` | `clock.now()` | How limiters read the current time, in seconds, from the clock they are given. |
+| `clock.read` | `clock.monotonic()` | How limiters and reports read the current time, in seconds, from the clock they are given; the `time` module itself qualifies. |
 | `bucket.signature` | `TokenBucket(capacity, refill_period, clock)` | Constructing a token bucket directly; `refill_period` is the seconds an empty bucket takes to refill to capacity. |
 
